-- window main Regex
div root  : v-flex size-full p=20 gap=14 bg=background
  form f  labels=side  label-width=90  tag=re
    field pat  label=Pattern
      input in  value=\b\w+@[\w.-]+  : font-family=monospace
    field opts  label=Options
      div row  : h-flex gap=20
        switch i  label='Ignore case'
        switch m  label='Dot matches newline'
        switch x  label=Extended
    field text  label=Text
      textarea in  rows=5  value=<<END  : font-family=monospace
Plan 9 from Bell Labs shipped in 1992; Inferno followed in 1996.
Mail rob@plan9.bell-labs.com or ken@plan9.bell-labs.com, or call
+1 908 582-3000. uitreefs 0.2 was tagged on 2026-11-22.

END
  div out  : v-flex gap=8 flex-1
    text h  text='2 matches'  : text-sm font-semibold
    styled-text hl  text=<<END  runs=<<END2  : p=12 rounded-md border-1 border-color=border bg=muted font-family=monospace text-sm
Plan 9 from Bell Labs shipped in 1992; Inferno followed in 1996.
Mail rob@plan9.bell-labs.com or ken@plan9.bell-labs.com, or call
+1 908 582-3000. uitreefs 0.2 was tagged on 2026-11-22.
END
70 23 bg=warning text-color=background font-bold
97 23 bg=info text-color=background font-bold
END2
    table t  stripe  columns=<<END  rows=<<END2  : flex-1
n # 40 align=right
at Offset 70 align=right
match Match 260
groups Groups 320
END
m0 1 70 "rob@plan9.bell-labs.com" ''
m1 2 97 "ken@plan9.bell-labs.com" ''
END2
-- menu/bar
-- keys
-- stderr
